{"4376040": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "MechaCap Arena", "steam_appid": 4376040, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4376040/extras/7c784eca01ebe0f67498d25c9af272ba.webp?t=1779178831\" width=1020 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4376040/extras/fef45cd59c81e6d18d6d7d54dc9828a5.poster.avif?t=1779178831\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4376040/extras/fef45cd59c81e6d18d6d7d54dc9828a5.webm?t=1779178831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4376040/extras/fef45cd59c81e6d18d6d7d54dc9828a5.mp4?t=1779178831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of a fledgling MechaCap pilot that sets out to become the national MechaCap Champion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a cast of quirky characters and experience challenges in arenas across four different towns. Bring your MechaCap to the arenas and clean, fight and race your way to victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4376040/extras/caa84d2059775e8afc3b256ca1af25e7.webp?t=1779178831\" width=914 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4376040/extras/9b2f92ba8d986515be242c5aac665c78.poster.avif?t=1779178831\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4376040/extras/9b2f92ba8d986515be242c5aac665c78.webm?t=1779178831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4376040/extras/9b2f92ba8d986515be242c5aac665c78.mp4?t=1779178831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect your gamepads and play locally - or invite Steam friends to play online via Remote Play Together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and tinker with your MechaCaps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean, race and fight in arenas across 4 different towns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow a light but heartfelt story with a quirky cast of characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personalize your MechaCap with different attachments and colour schemes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against your friends in up to 4 players in Battle Mode</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4376040/extras/7c784eca01ebe0f67498d25c9af272ba.webp?t=1779178831\" width=1020 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4376040/extras/fef45cd59c81e6d18d6d7d54dc9828a5.poster.avif?t=1779178831\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4376040/extras/fef45cd59c81e6d18d6d7d54dc9828a5.webm?t=1779178831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4376040/extras/fef45cd59c81e6d18d6d7d54dc9828a5.mp4?t=1779178831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></vi